      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَتَأَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَتَأُ</span>, (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَتْءٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>He
was heavy and slow</i> in his gait, <i>by reason of
age,</i> or <i>by nature.</i> (K.) Not mentioned by J.
because esteemed by him not chaste. (TA.)

